    <div class="features fade-in">
      <ul class="features-list">
        <li class="feature-item"><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4l16 4M8 6v10M16 8v10M6 16h4M14 18h4M10 16l4 2"/><rect x="6" y="12" width="4" height="4" rx=".5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="4" height="4" rx=".5"/></svg></div><div><h5>Liftnähe</h5><p>Nur 300 Meter zu Fuss zum Sessellift Chasellas.</p></div></li>
        <li class="feature-item"><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 20h10M9 20v-3a3 3 0 016 0v3"/><path d="M8 12c0-2 1.5-3 3-4s3-2 3-4"/><path d="M12 12c0-2 1.5-3 3-4s3-2 3-4"/><path d="M4 12c0-2 1.5-3 3-4s3-2 3-4"/></svg></div><div><h5>Panorama-Wellness inklusive</h5><p>Finnische Sauna, Biosauna, Dampfbad, Innen- &amp; Aussenwhirlpool – täglich 14–21 Uhr mit Bergblick.</p></div></li>
        <li class="feature-item"><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v7c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h2a2 2 0 002-2V3"/><path d="M7 3v18"/><path d="M21 15V3c-2.5 0-5 2-5 5v4a2 2 0 002 2h1v7"/></svg></div><div><h5>Halbpension &amp; Frühstück</h5><p>Reichhaltiges Buffet am Morgen, 4-Gang-Menu am Abend – regional, saisonal, mit Liebe.</p></div></li>
        <li class="feature-item"><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 17h14M5 17a2 2 0 01-2-2V9a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 17l-1 3h2M19 17l1 3h-2"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="13.5" r="1.5"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="13.5" r="1.5"/><path d="M5 9l2-4h10l2 4"/></svg></div><div><h5>Gratis Parkplatz &amp; Shuttle</h5><p>Aussenparkplätze am Hotel. Fahrplanmässiger Shuttlebus ins Dorf und zum Bahnhof.</p></div></li>
        <li class="feature-item"><div class="feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h18M3 14h18M8 6l-3 4M16 6l3 4M5 18h14a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="1"/></svg></div><div><h5>ÖV &amp; Bergbahnen inklusive</h5><p>Im gesamten Oberengadin und Bergell ab 2 Nächten kostenlos unterwegs – mit ÖV und Bergbahnen.</p></div></li>
